file "rcl_dynamic.sp" deck
  title "rcl_dynamic"
  comment " oracle: ngspice-45 inpcom.c inp_compat (an R/C/L reading v( i( temper hertz time runs as a B source: value, m, noisy, tc1, tc2 kept; reciproctc=1 on the C and on the charge form, A17), b_transformation_wanted, asrcload.c:41 (tc from 300.15 K: run tc, tnom=50 at 77 C, R1 {1k+0*v(a)} tc1=0.01 is 1500 ohm, the plain R2 1270 ohm); INV-semantics 6.14; R7 is gf180mcuD smbb000149.ngspice:287"
  element resistor R1 (a b) value=(v(a) * 1k) noisy=false
  element resistor R2 (a b) mult=2 value=(1k + v(a))
  element inductor L1 (a b) value=(1u * (1 + i(vx))) noisy=false
